# Mizaic-Frontend kit

Source: official **Mizaic Brand Guidelines** (PDF). Do not invent colours,
fonts, or logo treatments. This is the company kit. Do not call it the
HCCP-Frontend kit.

New UI uses **MUI** plus these tokens. Do not add Tailwind, Fluent, or a
second kit on a new file. Old kits are Wave 2 debt.

## Voice

Purpose: revolutionise the clinician : patient experience at the point of care.
Voice: **clear**, **purposeful**, **passionate**.
Strapline: The picture is clear with Mizaic.
Proposition: For the record.
Write **MediViewer** with capital M and V. MediViewer strapline: Your
patient data is clear with MediViewer.

## Digital colour (HEX / RGB only)

| Token | HEX | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Electric Blue | `#0d46d6` | Primary actions, links, focus |
| Violet | `#9338ff` | Accent |
| Royal Blue | `#002178` | Strong headings, dark buttons |
| Indigo | `#6600ab` | Secondary accent |
| Midnight Navy | `#00093b` | App shell, dark grounds |

Accents (layouts, not body on white unless AA): `#0071e2` `#0061ed`
`#0096fd` `#00d0ff` `#a129ff` `#b135ff` `#d13eff` `#ff72ff`.
Greys: `#000000` `#b5bac4` `#dce0e5` `#eaeef4` `#ffffff`.

In code, `primary.main` **must** be Electric Blue. Never paste HEX in a
component. Never use NHS Blue `#005eb8`.

## Type

- Headlines: **Overpass** (Light / SemiBold / Bold)
- UI, titles, body: **Albert Sans**
- Fallback only: **Arial** (for example PowerPoint)
- Do not add Inter, Roboto, or Helvetica as a brand face

## Logo

Official artwork only. Do not stretch, recolour, or add effects.
Clearance = width of the M. Digital minimums: 120px full logo, 80px
wordmark + mark, 60px wordmark. Top-left first. Drop the strapline only
when it would be illegible, then put the strapline or proposition nearby.
On navy: white wordmark + colour brandmark. Mono only when colour is
impossible. Do not pair the Mizaic brandmark beside the MediViewer logo.

## Icons and toolkit

Icons: 2D, square corners, 40° split, two official colours, part white on
dark grounds. Toolkit (one at a time, never combine): Clear View,
Viewfinder, Mizaic M, Data World.

## Accessibility

WCAG 2.1 AA. Text 4.5:1. Large text and UI 3:1. Check new pairs before
shipping. Clinical red / amber / green is allowed when AA passes. Chrome
and marketing stay on the Mizaic palette.
